OL,3,APolice probe after child dies in
OL,4,Awoodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched following the unexplained
OL,8,Fdeath of a child in woodland.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Freports of a child in cardiac arrest on
OL,12,Fland near Strawberry Lane, Cheslyn Hay,
OL,13,FStaffordshire, at about 08:45 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FAn air ambulance was sent to the scene,
OL,17,Fbut the child was pronounced dead by
OL,18,Fparamedics a short time later,
OL,19,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
